flowchart LR
  subgraph CLIENT[USER DEVICE]
    EX[Store-signed WebExtension]
    CH[Active compute host + workers]
    MP[Bundled/signed model pack]
    EX <--> CH
    CH <--> MP
  end
  EX -->|TLS, verified request only| RP[Reverse proxy / WAF]
  subgraph SERVICE[REMOTE MODULAR MONOLITH]
    RP --> API[Auth + schema + rate limit]
    API --> PP[Prompt/policy adapter]
    PP --> IQ[Bounded inference scheduler]
    IQ --> OV[Output schema validator]
  end
  IQ --> GPU[(GPU VLM runtime)]
  OV --> EX
  API -. content-free metrics .-> OBS[(Metrics + alerts)]
  CI[Protected CI / signing] -->|signed extension + model manifest| EX
  CI -->|digest-pinned image| SERVICE
